                  "Nimble: Barman poured one and left it on the counter. Did not say who for.",
                  "Forester: There is a candle at the fire nobody will admit to lighting.",
                  "Beard: Two stalkers at the fire, neither of them talking.",
                  "Barman: One of the traders shut up shop at noon. No reason given.",
                  "Forester: Flowers at the foot of a rusted sign. They will not last the night.",
                  "Owl: The reading on the long wave has not stopped. Different voice now.",
                  "Guide: Nobody has fired a shot near the checkpoint all day. Unusual.",
                  "Barman: Old man at the bar has been nursing the same drink since morning.",
                  "Nimble: Some rookie asked what day it was. Nobody answered him.",
                  "Sidorovich: Squad went out at first light and came straight back. Did not say why.",
                  "Sakharov: The dosimeters read the same as any other day. Feels wrong that they do.",
